        {"zh": "我的寄生卵在这！", "en": "My parasitic eggs here!"},
        {"zh": "骨荒原上，虫卵一片片。", "en": "Egg clusters dot the bone waste."},
        {"zh": "没人敢靠近我！", "en": "No one dares to come close!"},
        {"zh": "我就在这儿等你！", "en": "I'll wait for you here!"},
